1. Build full feature BSP
=========================

1.1 Setup BSP project
---------------------

	--machine nvidia-orin-agx --distro wrlinux-graphics --dl-layers --all-layers --accept-eula=yes

1.2 Setup environment and create a build directory
--------------------------------------------------

	$ . environment-setup-x86_64-wrlinuxsdk-linux
	$ . oe-init-build-env [<build>]


1.3 Setup local.conf
--------------------

Add below configurations at the end of local.conf

BB_NO_NETWORK = '0'
LICENSE_FLAGS_ACCEPTED += "commercial_faad2 commercial_x264 commercial"
BUILD_NVIDIA_PROPRIETARY_PACKAGE = "1"

require conf/customer-recipes/orin-full-feature.inc

1.4 Build project
-----------------

Build project with below command:

	bitbake wrlinux-image-std-sato

After building project completely, there is a compressed package as below:
<project path>/build/tmp/deploy/images/<MACHINE>/wrlinux-image-std-sato-<MACHINE>.rootfs.tegraflash.tar.zst
It will be used to NVIDIA Orin platform in later.
